Towns/cities and postcode area / nation tags (src/main/resources/dictionaries/GB/towns.txt)

A curated top-20 UK population ranking (see docs/dictionaries.md, "Towns/cities + postcode
area + nation tags"), verified against public reference sources rather than mined from a
single redistributed dataset. No third-party data attribution is required for this category.

