Street names (src/main/resources/dictionaries/GB/street-themes.txt,
src/main/resources/dictionaries/GB/street-types.txt)

English-only (see docs/dictionaries.md, "Street names", for why). Standard street-type
descriptor words are a matter of accuracy, not redistribution rights — not creative or
copyrightable content in their own right. Theme words are derived from published frequency
analyses of real UK street names, ultimately Ordnance Survey Open Names data, itself licensed
under the Open Government Licence v3.0.

