Organisation-name components (src/main/resources/dictionaries/GB/organisation-components.txt)

Contains public sector information from the Intellectual Property Office ("Trade Mark Data
Release", Domestic UK Applications dataset), licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0.
Word tokens only, mined from the dataset's owner-name field and filtered against personal
names — no owner names themselves are used or redistributed (see docs/dictionaries.md,
"Organisation-name components", and tools/mine_org_components.py).
